      "visualSettings": "{\"title\":{\"fontSize\":16},\"general\":{\"mode\":\"timeSeries\",\"type\":\"table\",\"displayType\":\"default\",\"outlierBandColor\":\"#FDECF5\",\"outlierBandMarkerColor\":\"#F032A9\",\"outlierBandFillOpacity\":0.3,\"outlierBandLineThickness\":2,\"outlierBandMarkerSize\":10,\"outlierBandMarkerType\":\"triangle\",\"fillOpacity\":1,\"aggregationType\":\"average\",\"groupBy\":[]},\"axes\":{},\"legend\":{},\"color\":{},\"hiddenQueryKeys\":[],\"overrides\":[],\"series\":{}}",
